      "componentName": "SliceBlockchainsSearch",
      "placeholder": "Search",
      "sliceId": "sliceBlockchainsSearch",
      "text": "Definica is built in three phases: pooled ETH staking through StakeWise Vault infrastructure, osETH-based liquidity through Aave V3 Ethereum, and borrowing markets for approved ETH-correlated collateral.\n\nThe Main Liquidity Module manages locked aEthosETH supply positions and, with user authorisation and where supported, borrowing against those positions through Aave. The borrowed assets provide liquidity to Definica’s lending markets, with explicit accounting for participant exposure, financing costs, lending income and separately funded incentives.",
      "title": "DeFi Infrastructure."
    },
